      <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[- Fixed Dock clicks remaining pressed for apps with multiple windows by preserving the physical mouse release whenever the press passes through.
- Prefer the target Dock icon’s App Exposé accessibility action, with a guarded notification fallback.
- Keep successful, acknowledged App Exposé actions tracked when macOS does not expose a matching visual window-list change.
- Added click-pairing and App Exposé dispatch regression coverage.]]></description>
